# Shell scripts here are run by bash (WSL / Linux droplets). A CRLF checkout breaks them in ways
# that are hard to read -- an unterminated heredoc reports only 'unexpected end of file' -- so
# pin them to LF regardless of the cloning platform's core.autocrlf.
*.sh   text eol=lf
*.py   text eol=lf

# Binaries and evidence must never be line-ending translated: their hashes are the whole point.
*.exe  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.gz   binary
*.dat  binary
*.asc  binary
